      "id": 1,
      "text": "Auburn was originally called Scotchman’s Lock, but the name changed to Auburn in 1842 when the Philadelphia and Reading Railroad arrived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
